# PixelSearch — environment variables
# =====================================================================
# The Flutter app reads NO environment variables and needs NO API keys.
# Search, indexing and People run on the device. Optional online features
# (captions, the assistant, cloud speech transcription) are off by default,
# need the user's consent, and go through the separately hosted
# enhancement backend (../enhancement_backend), which holds its own
# server-side secrets (GROQ_API_KEY, PIXELSEARCH_TOKEN_HASHES,
# GROQ_ZDR_CONFIRMED; see ../enhancement_backend/README.md). Never put
# those secrets in the app or in this file.
#
# The variable below is OPTIONAL and only affects the ModelKit build step
# (model regeneration), never the app.
# =====================================================================

# OPTIONAL — Hugging Face token. open_clip downloads the MobileCLIP-S1 weights
# from the HF Hub during `python prepare_model.py`. Unauthenticated works but is
# rate-limited; a token gives higher limits / faster downloads.
# HF_TOKEN=
